    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opponent's [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), right after an enemy unit finishes a [Normal Move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), Advance or Fall Back. Pick 1 **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** unit of yours (not **ARTILLERY** or **VEHICLE**) no more than 8\" from that enemy unit; you may also spend 2 [YP](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency).\n\nThe picked unit may move up to D6\" as a [Normal Move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), or up to 6\" instead if you spent the YP. It cannot [embark](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in a **TRANSPORT** during this move.",
